{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/presentacion.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/donde.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/god.png?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/cardis.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/abrill.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/palpitar.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3343480?t=1741116455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741116455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/9dc3e5d8b515daff70ebb7be204773219fd34219/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741116455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/9dc3e5d8b515daff70ebb7be204773219fd34219/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741116455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3551910,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/presentacion.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SeedGod</strong> is a roguelike deck builder inspired by the 1990 game Minesweeper. In this game, you must strategically plant crops in a field infested with bugs, and not planting is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Where is the bug?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/donde.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the numbers to guide you on where to plant and where not to plant your crops. If there\u2019s a 1, I wouldn\u2019t plant around it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The bugs can be aggressive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/god.png?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not only are they aggressive when you accidentally touch them, but they are also difficult to catch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique plants and tools.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/cardis.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some players hoard the best plants and tools, but if you have money, you can surely get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The smell of newness reaches here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/abrill.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes the merchant will be willing to sell you packages that can be very interesting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Gardener: Did you know that plants produce seeds?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343480/extras/palpitar.gif?t=1741116455\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you plant in the garden, the chance of one of your plants producing a seed increases with each plant sown. It might give you an epic seed, or it might not.</p>","developers":["El Diablillo Pandori"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"I